{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": 20040, "OID": 20040.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Right then, that is it from this abandoned game. The two finalists from this group are Australia Under-19\u00a0and South Africa Under-19, while West Indies Under-19\u00a0misses out narrowly. However, there is still one match going on in the ICC Under-19 World Cup 2024 where India Under-19 are on the verge of victory against Nepal Under-19. You can just switch tabs to enjoy all the action of that game. Cheers!", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T15:22:30+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": 20039, "OID": 20039.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Hugh Weibgen, the skipper of Australia Under-19\u00a0says that they are excited to play in the semi-final and he also credits\u00a0West Indies Under-19\u00a0for playing well. He continues that he was a bit quiet in the dressing room at the time of the innings break but he had full faith in the boys. He praised Sam Konstas\u00a0for his exceptional knock, and his important runs saved them at the end of the inning. He also praised Charlie Anderson\u00a0as he took two wickets with the new ball. He ends up saying that they had a bit of tactical error with the bat, and they would like to continue the good form in the semis as well.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T15:19:58+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "38", "UID": 20038, "OID": 20038.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Stephan Pascal, the captain of West Indies Under-19\u00a0says that it's a bit unfair to end their campaign like this but he feels like everything happens for a reason. Adds that the big\u00a0partnership in the middle for the Aussies was the turning point of the game as they bowled well in the initial stages and at the death. He tells\u00a0that because of the situation of the game,\u00a0Nathan Edward\u00a0couldn't complete his spell. Ends up saying that they need to have more awareness and patience in the game, which they will work on, in the future.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T15:17:32+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "37", "UID": 20037, "OID": 20037.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Presentation Time...", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T15:14:39+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": 20036, "OID": 20036.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the game, Australia Under-19\u00a0managed to post a competitive total on the board courtesy of a fantastic hundred from Sam Konstas\u00a0along with good contributions from skipper, Hugh Weibgen, and Rafael Macmillan. They lost half their side by under 100 runs but recovered really well to finish strongly. Nathan Edward\u00a0was the pick of the bowlers for West Indies Under-19\u00a0with three wickets while Isai Thorne\u00a0also continued his good form and picked up a couple. Except for Joshua Dorne, every other bowler chipped in with one wicket each. While\u00a0chasing, skipper, Stephan Pascal\u00a0started well with a couple of boundaries but fell in the first over, and then they lost another one before lighting halted proceedings here, and we could not get any further action as the two teams shared the points.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T15:14:17+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "35", "UID": 20035, "OID": 20035.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Bad news folks! The inevitable has happened and this game has been called off due to rain. The umpires were out to have a look at the conditions but they have decided that no further play is possible here at the Diamond Oval. We only got to see 4.3 overs of action in the chase, but it was filled with entertainment. The Windies batters hit a few lusty blows, but it was Charlie Anderson\u00a0who stole the show with his two wickets while Callum Vidler\u00a0also showcased his skills as a fast bowler. West Indies Under-19\u00a0knew that they had a tough ask on their hands, and the lighting and rain further dented their hopes here. However, they leave South Africa on the back of some excellent performance and a lot of learnings and experience. Australia Under-19, on the other hand, finishes on top of their Super-Six group with the shared points and will be looking forward to a semi-final now.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T15:05:25+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "34", "UID": 20034, "OID": 20034.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 8.08 pm IST (2.38 pm GMT) -\u00a0 It is now raining in Kimberley and it is all gloomy out there. In other news, South Africa U-19 have defeated Sri Lanka U-19 by 119 runs. That result means that the hosts have qualified for the semi-finals and kills off all\u00a0hopes that the West Indies Under-19. However, the Windies will still hope to finish on a positive note, but for that, the game needs to be resumed here. We hope that we get to see at least some action here. For now, the waiting game continues here...", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T14:38:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "33", "UID": 20033, "OID": 20033.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 7.04 pm IST (1.34 pm GMT) - Unfortunately, the covers are still firmly on and there is a lot of flashing and lightning going on. The players are waiting patiently in the dressing room but it does not look like\u00a0we will have a resumption anytime soon. While we continue to wait here, two other matches are going on currently in the ICC Under-19 World Cup 2024. South Africa U-19 are taking on Sri Lanka U-19 in a high-stakes encounter while India U-19 are up against Nepal U-19. You can just switch tabs to enjoy all the action of both games.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T13:34:50+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "32", "UID": 20032, "OID": 20032.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Oh..no! Lightning strikes once again at\u00a0Diamond Oval! It is not exactly right above the ground but close enough for the Umpires to take the players off for safety reasons. We hope the game resumes soon. Stay tuned for further updates.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T12:30:17+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "31", "UID": 20031, "OID": 20031.0, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,72,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "101800", "Bowler_Name": "Charlie Anderson", "Batsman": "90891", "Batsman_Name": "Jordan Johnson", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "FOUR! Gets off the mark with a boundary! Charlie Anderson\u00a0bangs this short and around leg, Jordan Johnson\u00a0swivels and tries to hook it away, but gets a top edge as the ball flies over the keeper and to the fine leg fence for four runs.", "Summary": {"Score": "24/2", "Over": "4.3", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "90891", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "111568", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "101800", "Overs": "2.3", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "2", "Ball_bowled": "15", "Dot_balls": "12"}], "Balls": "27", "Current_runrate": "5.33", "Required_runrate": "4.48"}, "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T12:28:50+00:00", "Non_Striker": "111568", "Non_Striker_Name": "Steve Wedderburn", "Score": "24/2", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "27", "Over_No": "5", "Ball": "3", "Ball_Line_Length": "15,20,11,16,59,14", "This_Over": "0(W),0,4,", "Batsman_Details": {"Batsman": "90891", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, "Non_Striker_Details": {"Batsman": "111568", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, "Bowler_Details": {"Bowler": "101800", "Overs": "2.3", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "2"}, "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "4.3: Charlie Anderson to Jordan Johnson, Four!", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "30", "UID": 20030, "OID": 20030.0, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "8,338,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "101800", "Bowler_Name": "Charlie Anderson", "Batsman": "90891", "Batsman_Name": "Jordan Johnson", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Fuller and on off, keeps low, Jordan Johnson\u00a0tries to block but gets an inside edge onto the leg side.", "Timestamp": "2024-02-02T1